{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386", "id": 842234631, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU4NDIyMzQ2MzE=", "number": 1386, "title": "How does \"Pause action\" work during mission", "user": {"login": "doman93", "id": 75940724, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQwNzI0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75940724?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93", "html_url": "https://github.com/doman93", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2021-03-26T19:14:56Z", "updated_at": "2021-03-29T13:03:59Z", "closed_at": "2021-03-29T13:02:52Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hello,  I am now studying the interrupt mechanism behind mission pause in the example of mavsdk\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/fly_mission/fly_mission.cpp\r\n\r\nIn this example, the variable \"want_to_pause\" is an atomic bool variable and initialized to be false (L202).\r\nThen author subscribes to mission process and sets it true if the mission_progress.current  >=2 to activate the interruption.\r\nThis interruption will start the code to pause the mission, then wait for 5s and then resume the mission. (L232-264)\r\n\r\nHowever, i have some questions:\r\n-  I do not observe the variable \"want_to_pause\" be reset to \"false\"; thereby this interruption will occur only once at mission_progress.current  ==2, i.e. mission >=3 will not call this interruption , is it right? How do I enable the pause properly, change \"want_to_pause\" variable back to \"false\"  at line L263?\r\n- During the pause process, I can use the offboard mode ?\r\n-  The code L228-230  concerning \" while  (!want_to_pause)\" serves for which reason? It has any connection with the interruption ?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "doman93", "id": 75940724, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQwNzI0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75940724?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93", "html_url": "https://github.com/doman93", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/doman93/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/809121675", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386#issuecomment-809121675", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386", "id": 809121675, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgwOTEyMTY3NQ==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-03-29T06:55:58Z", "updated_at": "2021-03-29T06:55:58Z", "body": "> I do not observer the variable \"want_to_pause\" be reset to \"false\"; thereby this interruption will occur only once at mission_progress.current ==2, i.e. mission >=3 will not call this interruption , is it right? How do I enable the pause properly, change \"want_to_pause\" variable back to \"false\" at line L263?\r\n\r\nIt's only set to `true` once, correct.\r\n\r\nYou could also call it at every waypoint like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    mission.subscribe_mission_progress([&want_to_pause](Mission::MissionProgress mission_progress) {\r\n        want_to_pause = true;\r\n    });\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen you would have to reset it somewhere else, e.g.\r\n```\r\nwhile (!want_to_pause) {\r\n    sleep_for(seconds(1));\r\n}\r\nwant_to_pause = false;\r\n```\r\n\r\n> During the pause process, I can use the offboard mode ?\r\n\r\nYes you can. Pause just means it goes to Hold/Loiter mode.\r\n\r\n> The code L228-230 concerning \" while (!want_to_pause)\" serves for which reason? It has any connection with the interruption ?\r\n\r\nThis waits until the flag is set to `true`.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/809121675/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/809359054", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386#issuecomment-809359054", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1386", "id": 809359054, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgwOTM1OTA1NA==", "user": {"login": "doman93", "id": 75940724, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQwNzI0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75940724?v=4",